      "group": "society",
      "stage": "university",
      "order": 51,
      "title": {
        "zh": "边际：再多一点值不值",
        "en": "The margin: is one more step worth it?"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "好的决定只问“再多一点值不值”：价格取决于最后那一杯水值多少，所以水比钻石便宜；学得越多，下一小时的收获越小，这是收益递减。",
        "en": "A good decision asks only whether one more step is worth it: price depends on what the last cup of water is worth, which is why water is cheaper than diamonds; each extra hour of study gains less, which is diminishing returns."
      },
      "source": "../demos/scarcity-moves/#c2",
