    {
      "id": "sunk-cost",
      "group": "society",
      "stage": "university",
      "order": 52,
      "title": {
        "zh": "沉没成本",
        "en": "Sunk cost"
      },
      "description": {
        "zh": "已经花掉、无论如何回不来的钱和时间不该进入决定；唯一该问的是接下来的时间用来干什么最好。难看的电影要不要看完、读了两年不喜欢的专业，是同一道题。",
        "en": "Money and time already spent and gone whatever you do should not enter the decision; the only question is how best to use what comes next. Sitting through a dreadful film and staying in a degree you dislike are the same problem."
      },
      "source": "../demos/scarcity-moves/#c2",
